        "39, 40"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasStatedDuration "P728D"^^xsd:duration ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "In a letter dated 7 August 2017, the applicant requested the Fund to enforce the annulment judgment... On 5 September 2017, the Fund responded, stating that a decision had already been made on 11 August 2017 regarding the enforcement of the relevant judgment."^^xsd:string,
        "On 30 June 2009, a valuation report issued by TSKB determined that the value of Radio Viva was USD 5,782,000 and the value of Viva TV was USD 132,000."^^xsd:string ;
    echr:isPending false ;
    echr:raisesArticle6Issue doc:issue_1 .

doc:domestic_proceeding_2 a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:domestic_proceeding_1 ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:authority_2 ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2006-07-20"^^xsd:date,
        "2015-07-07"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasInstanceLevel echr:LevelAppeal ;
    echr:hasOutcome echr:OutcomeQuashedAndRemitted ;
    echr:hasOutcomeDirection echr:DirectionFavourableToApplicant ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_2 ;
    echr:hasProceedingStartDate "2014-12-09"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasProceedingType echr:TypeAdministrative ;
    echr:hasSourceParagraph "29"^^xsd:string,
        "47"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 7 July 2015, following an appeal by the applicant, the General Assembly of the Administrative Proceedings Divisions of the Supreme Administrative Court ( Danıştay İdari Dava Daireleri Genel Kurulu – hereinafter “the General Assembly”), in line with the dissenting opinion, ruled that the estimated value of USD 6,000,000 had been determined on the basis of the 2009 valuation report, without any new assessment of the market value. The General Assembly concluded that the contested decision was not in compliance with the law, and, by a majority, annulled the Fund’s decision."^^xsd:string,
        "the Supreme Administrative Court, ruling unanimously, found that the applicant had a legal interest in the enforcement proceedings initiated under Law no. 6183, as he was the majority shareholder of İktisat Bank, which had been transferred to the Fund. The court held that the applicant had standing to challenge the transaction and quashed the administrative court’s earlier decision"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:raisesArticle6Issue doc:article6_issue_1 .

doc:proceeding_1 a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "Transfer of management of İktisat Bank to the Fund"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:authority_1,
        doc:domestic_authority_1 ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2001-03-15"^^xsd:date,
        "2014-03-19"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasInstanceLevel echr:LevelFirstInstance,
        echr:LevelInvestigative ;
    echr:hasOutcome echr:OutcomeClaimDismissed,
        echr:OutcomeMeasureImposed ;
    echr:hasOutcomeDirection echr:DirectionUnfavourableToApplicant ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_1 ;
    echr:hasProceedingStartDate "2001-03-15"^^xsd:date,
        "2008-04-03"^^xsd:date,
        "2011-02-24"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasProceedingType echr:TypeAdministrative ;
    echr:hasSourceLaw 4389 ;
    echr:hasSourceParagraph "13"^^xsd:string,
        "33"^^xsd:string,
        "6"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "By a decision dated 15 March 2001, the Banking Regulation and Supervision Board ... resolved to transfer the management and control of İktisat Bankası T.A.Ş. ... to the Savings Deposit Insurance Fund"^^xsd:string,
        "On 24 February 2011, the applicant initiated proceedings before the administrative court, seeking the annulment of the sale of Viva TV-Radio Viva."^^xsd:string,
        "On 3 April 2008, the Fund concluded that the Erol Aksoy Group had failed to fulfil several commitments and obligations set out in the Liquidation Protocol, rendering the Protocol no longer effective for the recovery of public receivables. Consequently, the Fund decided to rely on its provisions concerning default. It resolved to initiate legal proceedings against all natural and legal person debtors within the Erol Aksoy Group and to proceed with the sale of assets, including those consolidated as an economic and commercial unit."^^xsd:string ;
    echr:isFinalDomesticDecision false ;
    echr:isPending false ;
    echr:isProceedingInCase doc:case_document_1 ;
    echr:raisesArticle6Issue doc:article6_issue_1,
        doc:issue_1 .

doc:proceeding_2 rdfs:label "Proceedings to annul decisions on valuation and sale of Viva TV-Radio Viva"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasCourt doc:authority_1,
        doc:authority_2,
        doc:domestic_authority_3 ;
    echr:hasDecisionDate "2014-12-09"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasInstanceLevel echr:LevelAppeal,
        echr:LevelCassation,
        echr:LevelFirstInstance ;
    echr:hasOutcome echr:OutcomeMeasureImposed,
        echr:OutcomeUpheldOnAppeal ;
    echr:hasOutcomeDirection echr:DirectionFavourableToApplicant,
        echr:DirectionUnfavourableToApplicant ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_2 ;
    echr:hasProceedingStartDate "2008-09-18"^^xsd:date,
        "2014-03-19"^^xsd:date ;
    echr:hasProceedingType echr:TypeAdministrative ;
    echr:hasSourceParagraph "1"^^xsd:string,
        "14"^^xsd:string,
        "35"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 18 September 2008, the Fund further resolved to transfer the management and control of all companies within the Erol Aksoy Group to itself, along with the rights of their shareholders, except for the entitlement to dividends."^^xsd:string,
        "On an appeal by the applicant, the 13th Chamber of the Supreme Administrative Court upheld that decision on 9 December 2014."^^xsd:string,
        "The case concerns the non-enforcement of judgments delivered by the Supreme Administrative Court following proceedings initiated by the applicant to annul decisions related to the valuation, tender invitation and subsequent sale of a television channel and radio station owned by joint-stock companies in which the applicant held shares."^^xsd:string ;
    echr:isFinalDomesticDecision false ;
    echr:isPending false ;
